# List user availability statuses

GET https://api.close.com/api/v1/user/availability/

List user availability statuses for all users in an organization.

The `active_calls` field is an array of call metadata for calls that the user is currently participating in.

Reference: https://developer.close.com/api/resources/users/list-availabilities

## Authentication

- `Authorization` header (basic auth, required) — Use your API key as the username and leave the password empty.
- `Authorization` header (bearer token, required) — Bearer authentication of the form `Bearer
`, where token is your auth token.

## Request

### Query parameters

- `organization_id` (string, optional)

## Response

### 200

Successful response

## Errors

### 400 Bad Request Error

Bad request

- `any`

### 401 Unauthorized Error

Unauthorized

- `any`

### 404 Not Found Error

Not found

- `any`

